<title>UK: NATIONAL POWER, POWERGEN UP ON BOUNCE.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL POWER, POWERGEN UP ON BOUNCE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Power Plc and PowerGen Plc rose on Monday, bucking the broader market's sell-off, on a technical bounce and stock shortage, traders said.</p>
<p>By 1011 GMT, National Power shares were up 9p at 532p and PowerGen gained 15-1/2p to 720p. Other electricity stocks were mixed.</p>
